      <div class="step-desc">The model undergoes recursive backbone transformations. Instead of token generation, activations are iteratively refined directly in vector space.</div>
      <div class="step-code">h_&#123;k+1&#125; = TransformerBlock(h_k)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-box" id="step-card-2">
