  <div class="callout-content">
    <strong>Downstream Scaling:</strong> Aside from reasoning, latent representation supports **Planning** (via latent trajectory foresight), **Memory** (compressing KV caches into continuous memory slots), and **Collaboration** (agents sending continuous vectors rather than explicit tokens).
  </div>
</blockquote>
</section>

<section id="s-benchmarks" data-code="benchmarks">
<div class="section-no">06 — Payoff & Future</div>
<h2>Benchmarks: Efficiency and Trade-offs</h2>
<p>Latent space models demonstrate substantial improvements across multiple benchmarks. By avoiding sequential autoregressive token-generation chains, these models significantly increase generation speed, reduce parameter footprint via recursive parameters, and drastically slash decoded token volumes.</p>

